.superpowers/

# Screen recordings. The OAuth verification video is ~390MB; git history is effectively
# permanent and GitHub rejects blobs over 100MB. Upload these to YouTube, keep the link
# in the docs, and leave the file out of the repository.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
